{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "df8094de-336f-84f2-a66f-99b5d68cdbbe",
  "created_at": "2025-12-20T11:47:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Andres Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:45:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:45:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. Good morning. I am calling about a drain problem. I have, um, a paper here, so I read it slowly, please. Excuse me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:45:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:45:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am calling the storm line because I see it is not the regular hours of City Hall. It is Saturday. I hope this is the correct number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:46:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, this is the right line. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:46:08-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After the big rain Wednesday and Thursday, two days ago, the water is still standing at the crosswalk near the school bus stop. It is a big pool across the whole crosswalk. The kids, they step out into the road to go around it. This is dangerous, with the cars."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:46:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yeah, that's not good. What street is that on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:46:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ayrault Street. I live at three five four Ayrault Street. The crosswalk is right near my house. Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:46:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 354 Ayrault. Writing down standing water at the crosswalk by the bus stop, kids walking into the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:46:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Also, one more thing on my paper. There is a manhole cover that looks off by one inch. Not flat. Like it is, um, raised on one side. Close to the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:46:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, manhole cover sitting uneven, about an inch. I'll put that in too. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:46:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Andres Cordero. A-N-D-R-E-S. Please check it. My phone, the autocorrect, it keeps changing names. Yesterday it changed my own name in a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:47:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It does that. Andres Cordero, Andres with an S, got it. Want to leave a number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:47:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four zero one, five five five, zero one five nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:47:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-nine. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:47:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now my question. Will you open a work order? And for what date? I need to know the date, because every day the children are there in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:47:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll open a work order today, with both items. As for a date, crews are working through a backlog from the storm, so I'd say early next week is realistic, and I'll flag the bus stop as a safety item so it gets looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:47:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Early next week. Okay. Thank you. I hope it is sooner, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-20T11:47:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that. Thanks for calling, Andres."
    }
  ],
